@startuml getFcPortAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getFcPortAsync – Retrieve fc-port by localId from Forwarding-Construct
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "ForwardingConstruct" as fcRes #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - forwardingConstructUuid
  - fcPortLocalId
end note

requestor -> fcRes: (forwardingConstructUuid, fcPortLocalId)
activate fcRes

fcRes -> jd: read forwarding-construct
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct
jd --> fcRes: fc-port list from forwarding-construct
deactivate jd

note over fcRes
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through fc-port entries
  - Match fc-port's localId with fcPortLocalId
  - Return fc-port object if found
  - Return undefined if no match exists
end note

fcRes --> requestor: fcPortObject | undefined
deactivate fcRes

@enduml
